  "body": "Please can we publish packages to the apt repository for [Debian Trixie (13)](https://wiki.debian.org/DebianTrixie) which is the current testing release at the time of writing. It became the current testing release on 2023-06-10.\r\n\r\nI run debian testing on the server I run synapse on and the change from bookworm to trixie has meant that I now get errors on `apt update`:\r\n\r\n```\r\nE: The repository 'https://packages.matrix.org/debian trixie Release' does not have a Release file.\r\n```",
